{"level":30,"time":1778536907331,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U8xfZx9fAtucpDxZE2vXqr","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Site Plan Facts\n     2→\n     3→# Facts — Valley View Townhomes (SP-2025-0126C)\n     4→**3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX 78704**\n     5→\n     6→---\n     7→\n     8→## Discrepancies\n     9→\n    10→- **Easement (Greenbelt Access & Use, Instrument 2010070731):** A perpetual, no-build greenbelt easement covering 0.31 acres (13,524 sq ft) of the NE interior of Lot 1 is NOT depicted on the submitted site plan and is NOT in the COA GIS easement layer. County clerk research confirms it is real, recorded, and perpetual. Must be depicted before approval.\n    11→- **Easement (City of Austin Drainage, Instrument 2011021137):** A perpetual City of Austin drainage easement covering 0.130 acres (5,670 sq ft) of the NE corner of Lot 1 is NOT depicted on the submitted site plan and is NOT in the COA GIS easement layer. County clerk research confirms it is real, recorded, and perpetual. Must be depicted before approval.\n    12→- **Combined NE no-build zone (~0.44 ac):** Together, the two easements above encumber approximately 0.44 acres (~19%) of the NE portion of the 2.16-acre site. Neither is shown on submitted plans. Proposed building layout must be evaluated against both easement footprints.\n    13→- **Acreage:** Site plan states 2.16 ac; 2019 deed/survey states 2.158 ac; TCAD states 2.1970 ac; COA GIS parcel measures 2.111 ac (91,944 sq ft). If the controlling acreage is 2.111 ac (GIS), the IC calculation based on 2.16 ac should be rechecked.\n    14→- **10' Wastewater Easement (Vol 73/76, C8S-75-160):** COA GIS shows this plat-dedicated easement running across the parcel. Not confirmed on the submitted site plan. Site plan notes \"must verify no conflicts.\"\n    15→- **25' Drainage Easement and 7.5' PUE (Vol 64/13, C8-71-079):** GIS shows these easements (from the Cortez Heights plat) running across the NE boundary of Lot 1. Not verified on site plan. Precise location relative to proposed improvements must be confirmed.\n    16→- **FIRM Panel Number:** Site plan cites Panel #48453C0585H (effective September 26, 2008). FloodPro returns null for both FIRM_PANEL and EFFECTIVE_DATE. Must be independently verified on FEMA Flood Map Service Center.\n    17→- **Demolition permit number:** Site plan cites \"2022-101266 BP\" as the demolition permit. Amanda shows 2022-101266 as a Plumbing Permit (Repair); the actual demolition building permit is 2022-096813 BP (Final). Actual demolition is confirmed complete.\n    18→\n    19→---\n    20→\n    21→## Property\n    22→\n    23→- **Address:** 3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX 78704\n    24→- **Parcel ID (GeoID):** 0406100252\n    25→- **Legal Description:** Lot 1, Mecey Subdivision, Volume 73, Page 76, Plat Records of Travis County, Texas\n    26→- **Subdivision:** Mecey Subdivision (File No. C8S-75-100)\n    27→- **Plat Instrument:** Vol 73 / Pg 76 (Instrument 418356), filed 1975-12-11\n    28→- **County:** Travis\n    29→- **Site Area (site plan):** 2.16 acres\n    30→- **Site Area (2019 deed/survey):** 2.158 acres\n    31→- **Site Area (TCAD):** 2.1970 acres (95,701 sq ft)\n    32→- **Site Area (COA GIS parcel):** 2.111 acres (91,944 sq ft)\n    33→- **Limits of Construction:** 2.26 acres\n    34→- **Survey of Record (likely):** 2018 CDS Survey, Project No. 18-03-0225:021\n    35→- **Current Land Use:** Vacant land (formerly assisted living / nursing care facility; demolished June 2022)\n    36→\n    37→## Ownership\n    38→\n    39→- **Owner:** WM 41 Austin RE, LLC\n    40→- **Owner Mailing Address:** 500 West 5th Street, Ste. 1010, Austin, TX 78701\n    41→- **Acquisition Deed:** Instrument 2019197883 — Special Warranty Deed from SHG Resources LP to WM 41 Austin RE LLC (2019-12-11). Property conveyed