{"level":30,"time":1778536914899,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01SC2MRLg7rATSPvAMpZDysF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this site plan review task. I'm looking at the grouping file for \"Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines\" (el-md-exp/1.md).\n\nKey information from the grouping file:\n1. This is about clearances between overhead electric distribution/transmission facilities and proposed site features\n2. Key clearance requirements:\n   - 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground clearance from conductors\n   - 15-foot radial clearance from distribution primary and neutral conductors\n   - 16 feet vertical clearance for driveways/parking without truck traffic\n   - 18 feet vertical clearance for roads/streets with truck traffic\n   - 10 lateral feet from distribution conductors for trees\n   - 30-40 lateral feet from transmission conductors for trees (UCM § 1.10.10.4 requires 50 lateral feet)\n\nThe project is: Valley View Townhomes, 39 multi-family townhome units, 8 buildings, located at 3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX 78704.\n\nFrom the facts.md, I can see:\n- This is on Valley View Road (ASMP Street Level 1 - Local Street)\n- Site area is 2.16 acres\n- Zoning: MF-2\n- No flood zone issues\n- No transmission line issues mentioned\n- Multiple easements on the property\n\nNow I need to understand if this grouping applies to this project. The \"Documents to Review\" section lists:\n- Site Plan Sheets\n- Building Elevation Sheets\n- Section/Profile Exhibits\n- Survey Data\n- Landscape Plans\n- Utility Plans\n- Cover Sheet\n\nLet me check the site plan sheets to see if there are overhead electric facilities on or adjacent to the site. From the README:\n- Sheet 21 is \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\" - Layout of preliminary electrical design, routing, transformers, and meters\n\n\n- Sheet 31 is \"Landscape Plan\"\n\nI need to determine whether overhead lines are present on or near the property, since the entire grouping's applicability hinges on this. I'll examine the electrical design sheet details and other documentation to understand what electrical infrastructure exists.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16242,"cache_read_input_tokens":24720,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16242},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1cf9b9a6-a069-491a-8521-ba77a83a73f4","uuid":"2ab06446-3b46-416d-acf2-ed7f4db9faa8"}
