{"level":30,"time":1778536915081,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01KprfdH3S3tM9Y7PzmJjhAA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Alright, let me understand the context:\n\n**Grouping:** EL-MD-EXP 2.md - \"Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines\"\n\n**Project:** Valley View Townhomes (SP-2025-0126C) — 39 townhome units on 2.16 acres\n\n**Applicability Gate:**\nThe grouping is specifically about tree placement near overhead electric distribution and transmission lines. The key questions:\n1. Are there overhead electric distribution or transmission lines present or proposed on the site?\n2. Are trees being planted near these lines?\n\nFrom the facts.md:\n- The site plan lists Easement 7 & 8 as 5' Electric Easements (plat-dedicated)\n- No mention of transmission lines or transmission easements\n- No indication that overhead electric distribution lines are a major feature\n\nFrom the README:\n- Sheet 21: \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\" — Layout of preliminary electrical design, routing, transformers, and meters\n- Sheet 31: \"Landscape Plan\" — Landscape design plan featuring planting details and irrigation notes\n- Sheet 32: \"Tree List\" — Detailed list of surveyed trees\n- Sheet 35: \"Landscape Calculations\" — Plant lists and tree preservation notes\n- Sheet 37: \"Landscape Details\" — Tree planting and tree protection details\n\nThe project has:\n- Existing trees (Sheet 30, 32, 33, 34)\n- Proposed landscape with new plantings (Sheet 31, 36, 37)\n- Electric infrastructure (Sheet 21)\n\n**Key Threshold Question:** Are there overhead electric distribution or transmission lines present on or near the site? And if so, are trees proposed within the restricted clearance zones?\n\nLet me examine the relevant sheets to determine applicability:\n1. Sheet 21 (Preliminary Electrical Design Plan) — to check for overhead lines\n2. Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) — to check tree locations and any proximity to utility lines\n\n\n3. Sheet 32 (Tree List) — to identify what species are being planted\n4. Sheet 35 (Landscape Calculations) — to review the plant schedule and species information\n5. Sheet 36 (Biofiltration Pond Plans & Calculations) — to check for any plantings in the pond area\n\nI need to review these sheets first to determine whether this grouping actually applies to the project.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11788,"cache_read_input_tokens":24720,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11788},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d74c420c-89c8-4919-b9c5-9dc6ffa1b186","uuid":"1b788ffd-0173-46cb-8407-8718878c46a7"}
