{"level":30,"time":1778537149738,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01JeUXdz8nvimZxLLzbzeEZx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! Now I have critical information from the blocks:\n\nFrom Sheet 4 (Existing Conditions Survey):\n- The legend shows: \"O.H.U.L. OVERHEAD UTILITY LINE\" symbol is defined\n- This means overhead utilities may be shown on the plan\n\nFrom Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan):\n- Block 2 explicitly mentions: \"Utility lines such as water (W), storm drain (SD), and **overhead electric (OHE)**\"\n- So the landscape plan references overhead electric lines by the notation \"OHE\"\n\nFrom Sheet 21 (Preliminary Electrical Design Plan):\n- Shows underground electric lines, transformers, pull boxes, meters\n- This is all UNDERGROUND infrastructure, not overhead\n\nSo it appears:\n1. The site has OVERHEAD ELECTRIC FACILITIES noted on the landscape plan (Sheet 31)\n2. The site has UNDERGROUND electric infrastructure shown on Sheet 21\n3. The existing survey (Sheet 4) includes utility lines\n\nNow I need to determine:\n- Are there existing overhead electric facilities on or adjacent to the site?\n- Does the site plan show how proposed features clear from overhead facilities?\n\nThis is critical because the entire grouping EL-1 is about clearances from overhead electric lines. If there are NO overhead electric facilities on or adjacent to the site, most/all items would be n/a.\n\nHowever, I see from Sheet 31 that \"Overhead Electric (OHE)\" is listed among the utility lines shown on the landscape plan. This suggests there ARE overhead electric facilities present.\n\nLet me check Sheet 1 (Cover Sheet) and Sheet 9 (Site Plan) blocks to see if there are any notes about overhead facilities or clearances. I should also look at the cover sheet for any utility notes.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5816,"cache_read_input_tokens":47179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5816},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26e43ce3-83cf-4ed7-a640-b8c0dd12039a","uuid":"6d0f3950-7a0c-459c-9284-7d8425a08588"}
