{"level":30,"time":1778539029622,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01FR8QTiSePu4UWVZuFB7JB6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have more critical findings:\n\n**EL-13.37 (Transformer pad dimensions):**\n- Transformer pad dimensions are NOT labeled on the site plan\n- There are NO references to Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets\n- This is a FAIL/NOT-VERIFIABLE\n\n**EL-13.21 (5-foot clearance to water lines):**\n- Transformer Pad near Bldg. 1: 46.2 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad west of Bldg. 2: 11.7 feet - PASS (barely)\n- Transformer Pad west of Bldg. 8: 60.9 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad between Bldg. 5 and Bldg. 6: 32.7 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad southeast of Bldg. 7: 44 feet - PASS\nAll appear to meet the 5-foot minimum.\n\n**EL-13.22 (5-foot clearance to wastewater lines):**\n- Transformer Pad west of Bldg 1: 12.2 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad west of Bldg 2: 82.5 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad west of Bldg 8: 67.7 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad between Bldg 4 and Bldg 5: 19.4 feet - PASS\n- Transformer Pad between Bldg 7 and Bldg 6: 29.9 feet - PASS\nAll appear to meet the 5-foot minimum.\n\n**EL-13.34 (Transformer pads not in prohibited easements):**\n- At least TWO transformer pads are located WITHIN easement areas:\n  1. One pad (east of between Bldg 4 and Bldg 5) is within the 25' Drainage Easement\n  2. Another pad (east of Bldg 7) is within the 15' Easement and 5' Electric Easement\n- This is a FAIL - transformers cannot be located in drainage easements without City approval\n\nI should also verify whether the site plan documents the transformer service type (single-phase versus three-phase), and check for any fire escapes, fire lanes, or retaining walls positioned near the transformer pads.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5119,"cache_read_input_tokens":64610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5119},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85cce1e8-6e77-4208-9a6d-06fe1aa951a1","uuid":"adbf88c7-c1e6-4065-8a6e-7acf75991684"}
