{"level":30,"time":1778542382208,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013fw7L1Uu4k1njK3PW4hVy7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good:\n\n**EL-13.23 (5-foot clearance from storm drain lines):**\n- All transformer pads are 27.9+ feet from storm drain lines\n- All PASS\n\n**EL-13.25 (12-inch clearance from other underground utilities):**\n- Most transformers are 17+ feet from utilities\n- One transformer pad (near Unit 504/east side) is only 17.1 feet from nearest utility, which is well above 12 inches\n- All appear to PASS\n\nNow let me compile my final findings. I need to prepare the structured output with all the items that are fail or not-verifiable.\n\n**CRITICAL DEFICIENCIES FOUND:**\n\n1. **EL-13.1** - Two transformer pads at 0 feet from buildings (west of Bldg 2 and east of Bldg 7) - FAIL\n\n2. **EL-13.19** - One transformer pad (west of Bldg. 8) only 3.5 feet from fire lane, requires 15 feet - FAIL\n\n3. **EL-13.34** - At least two transformer pads located within prohibited drainage easements without documented AE Design approval - FAIL\n\n4. **EL-13.37** - Transformer pad dimensions not labeled and no reference to AE Design-approved detail sheets - NOT-VERIFIABLE\n\n5. **EL-13.35** - No transformer easements shown on plat (only general utility easements) - FAIL\n\n6. **EL-13.38** - At least one transformer pad (west of Bldg. 1) is within 4 feet of driveway/parking curb without bollards shown - FAIL\n\n7. **EL-13.32** - Transformer pads not labeled on grading plan; cannot verify oil-filled status or drainage direction - NOT-VERIFIABLE\n\n\n8. **EL-13.36** - An electrical line on the south side appears to run at or along the property boundary with no clearance shown - NOT-VERIFIABLE or FAIL. **EL-13.10** - One transformer pad between Buildings 3 and 5 sits only 3.2 feet from Bldg. 3, which may violate clearance depending on access door placement - needs clarification. **EL-13.13** - One tree measures 11.2 feet from a transformer pad, just outside the 10-foot minimum, but appears acceptable.\n\nI should verify the tree species to ensure it meets compatibility requirements with the electrical infrastructure.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4234,"cache_read_input_tokens":77033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4234},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85cce1e8-6e77-4208-9a6d-06fe1aa951a1","uuid":"33d6efde-7ba3-4ad5-8c96-fa6651ca5528"}
{"level":30,"time":1778542382208,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013fw7L1Uu4k1njK3PW4hVy7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me compile my research summary and prepare the final evaluation. Based on my comprehensive vision checks and document review, I have identified several critical deficiencies. Let me prepare the structured findings output.\n\n## Research Summary\n\n**Transformer Pad Locations Identified:**\n- West of Building 1: ~38.4 feet from building\n- West of Building 2: 0 feet from building (TOUCHING)\n- West of Building 8: ~52 feet from building  \n- Between Buildings 4-5: ~10.8 feet from building\n- East of Building 7: 0 feet from building (TOUCHING)\n- Between Buildings 3-5: ~3.2 feet from Bldg. 3\n\n**Key Findings from Vision Checks:**\n\n**CRITICAL DEFICIENCIES:**\n1. Two transformer pads have 0-foot clearance from buildings (EL-13.1 FAIL)\n2. One transformer pad 3.5 feet from fire lane, requires 15 feet (EL-13.19 FAIL)\n3. At least two transformer pads located in prohibited drainage easements (EL-13.34 FAIL)\n4. Transformer pad west of Bldg. 1 within 4 feet of parking curb without bollards (EL-13.38 FAIL)\n5. No transformer pad dimensions or AE Design detail references shown (EL-13.37 NOT-VERIFIABLE)\n6. No separate transformer easements shown on plat (EL-13.35 FAIL)\n7. Transformer pad dimensions not shown on grading plan; cannot verify drainage or oil-filled status (EL-13.32 NOT-VERIFIABLE)\n8. Electrical service line at south property boundary at 0 feet (EL-13.36 NOT-VERIFIABLE)\n\n**ITEMS THAT PASS:**\n- 5-foot clearance from retaining walls: All meet requirement (126+ feet)\n- 5-foot clearance from water lines: All meet requirement (11.7+ feet)\n- 5-foot clearance from wastewater lines: All meet requirement (12+ feet)\n- 5-foot clearance from storm drains: All meet requirement (27.9+ feet)\n- 12-inch clearance from other utilities: All meet requirement (17+ feet)\n- 100% on private property: All meet requirement (6.1+ feet from boundary)\n- Fire hydrant clearance: 28.9 feet from hydrant (PASS)\n\n**NOT APPLICABLE ITEMS:**\n- No fences/gates adjacent to transformers\n- No dumpsters shown\n- No sidewalks adjacent to transformers\n- No fire escapes shown\n- No overhead distribution lines on site\n- No niche installations\n- No gas service shown\n\nNow let me generate the structured output with findings."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4234,"cache_read_input_tokens":77033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4234},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85cce1e8-6e77-4208-9a6d-06fe1aa951a1","uuid":"ad73fcca-fb22-4385-8db9-c491bc1ff2e7"}
