{"level":30,"time":1778542460583,"pid":99088,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","retry":1,"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01JyiGERZXKm5UjKdp5NqGYX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Critical finding for EL-13.12:\n\n**Fire Hydrant Clearance (EL-13.12):**\n- Fire Hydrant location: Southeast curve of the inner fire lane, south of Building 7 (Unit 705)\n- Transformer pad immediately east of the hydrant: Only 3.1 feet away\n\nThis is a FAIL - the minimum clearance required is 5 feet, but only 3.1 feet is provided.\n\nNow I need to continue checking other items. Let me check for:\n- Sidewalk clearances (EL-13.7)\n- Retaining wall clearances (EL-13.2)\n- Fences and gates (EL-13.3)\n- Overhead distribution lines (EL-13.27, EL-13.28)\n- Transformer easements (EL-13.35)\n- Easement conflicts (EL-13.34)\n- Vegetation (EL-13.14, EL-13.15)\n- Other amenities (dumpsters, bike racks, light poles, fire lanes, etc.)\n- Oil-filled transformer drainage (EL-13.32)\n- Overhead structures/niches (EL-13.29, EL-13.30, EL-13.31)\n- Cross-reference sheets (EL-13.26, EL-13.36)\n\nLet me continue with more vision checks.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2546,"cache_read_input_tokens":77690,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2546},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3acdde33-d1c5-4711-add7-cfe5036f8982","uuid":"fec69f08-d228-4519-a118-b66e5826c44f"}
